    ("#022//Khulan", "%3Khulan%% has a stratagem for the Khan's consideration. The barren peaks bear not a blade of grass. Deserters and fugitives have all crammed into that summit, straining their supplies. If we sever their supply lines below, hunger alone will bring them to their knees."),
